(7802199, 1301665, 274374, '<td valign="top">
Thank you so much for the kind words, beatabg :) The tower is lit on September 9th, Lennon''s birthday each year. This year, at first, I felt we shouldn''t light the tower - the state of the world is in such a bad place, so many on-going conflicts and so much tension. But after a few days I realized, we need all the beacons we can get. Thanks again for the comment - I am planning on posting some outtakes today to the Outtake thread which might offer different perspectives to this location and to prove that this indeed, is a freestanding singular door that makes no sense at all.
<br/>
